# NOTE: production serves this app via the merged masjid-live Pages project,
# whose canonical _headers is written by tooling/merge-pages.js. This file
# only applies to a standalone Pages deploy of this app (none today).
# Never put Cache-Control on broad patterns here — Cloudflare COMBINES all
# matching rules (see docs/unified-deploy.md lesson 2).
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
